    <patterns>
      <pattern name="Request-independent survivor election" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/ExternalAccess/ExternalGrantLifecycle.cs:190-256">
        `ConferralRank` + `ElectSurvivor`: a total order over rows that depends only on the ROW and `today`, so two racers compute the same order. Read the remarks before changing anything nearby — they record why a request value must never enter.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Truthful unknown-outcome refusal" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/ExternalAccess/SetRecordShareExpiryEndpoint.cs:218-234">
        A write whose outcome cannot be confirmed refuses without claiming "nothing changed" — it states the all-or-nothing invariant and tells the caller to reload. Mirror this wording for an unverifiable collapse.
      </pattern>
